### Chat completion (SSE)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "local",
  "stream": true,
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Say hello in one short sentence." }
  ]
}

### Chat completion (non-streaming)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "local",
  "stream": false,
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Count to three." }
  ]
}
